msgid "Symmetry-adapted intermolecular perturbation theory"
msgstr "对称性匹配的分子间微扰理论"

msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "引言"

msgid ""
"The SAPT (symmetry-adapted intermolecular perturbation theory) program "
"calculates the total interaction energy between closed-shell molecules as a "
"sum of individual first and second order interaction terms, namely "
"electrostatic :math:`E_{\\text{pol}}^{(1)}`, induction "
":math:`E_{\\text{ind}}^{(2)}` and dispersion :math:`E_{\\text{disp}}^{(2)}` "
"accompanied by their respective exchange counterparts "
"(:math:`E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}`, :math:`E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}` and "
":math:`E_{\\text{exch-disp}}^{(2)}`). The latter ones arise due to electron "
"exchange between the monomers when the molecules are close to each other and"
" are sometimes denoted as Pauli repulsion. Since all above terms are "
"accessible through density matrices and static and dynamic density-density "
"response functions of the monomers, in principle (see section `high order "
"terms <symmetry-adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#high-order-"
"terms>`__) no calculation of the dimer wave function is required. Therefore "
"SAPT is free from the basis set superposition error which occurs in the "
"supermolecular approach."
msgstr ""
"SAPT（对称性匹配的分子间微扰理论）程序计算闭壳层分子间的总相互作用能，其为一阶和二阶相互作用项之和，即静电项 "
":math:`E_{\\text{pol}}^{(1)}`\\ 、诱导项 :math:`E_{\\text{ind}}^{(2)}` 和色散项 "
":math:`E_{\\text{disp}}^{(2)}`\\ ，并伴有它们各自的交换对应项（\\ "
":math:`E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}`\\ 、\\ :math:`E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}` 和 "
":math:`E_{\\text{exch-disp}}^{(2)}`\\ "
"）。后者源于分子彼此靠近时单体间的电子交换，有时被称为泡利排斥。由于上述所有项均可通过单体的密度矩阵以及静态和动态密度-密度响应函数获得，原则上（参见 "
"`高阶项 <symmetry-adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#high-order-"
"terms>`__ 一节）无需计算二聚体波函数。因此，SAPT 避免了超分子方法中出现的基组叠加误差。"

msgid "References:"
msgstr "参考文献："

