msgstr "he2.svg"

msgid ""
"Currently SAPT only accepts single-determinant wave functions for the "
"monomers, i.e. from Hartree-Fock or Kohn-Sham DFT (see next section) "
"calculations. This means that if Hartree-Fock wave functions are used for "
"monomer, the following quantity is obtained (zero in superscript denotes "
"that no intramonomer correlation is accounted for) [1]."
msgstr ""
"目前 SAPT 仅接受单体的单行列式波函数，即来自 Hartree-Fock 或 Kohn-Sham "
"DFT（参见下一节）计算的结果。这意味着如果对单体使用 Hartree-Fock 波函数，则得到以下量（上标中的零表示未考虑单体内相关）[1]。"

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"E_{\\text{SAPT}}=E^{(10)}_{\\text{pol}}+E^{(10)}_{\\text{exch}}+\n"
"               E^{(20)}_{\\text{ind,resp.}}+\n"
"   E^{(20)}_{\\text{exch-ind,resp.}}+E^{(20)}_{\\text{disp}}+\n"
"   E^{(20)}_{\\text{exch-disp}}\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"E_{\\text{SAPT}}=E^{(10)}_{\\text{pol}}+E^{(10)}_{\\text{exch}}+\n"
"               E^{(20)}_{\\text{ind,resp.}}+\n"
"   E^{(20)}_{\\text{exch-ind,resp.}}+E^{(20)}_{\\text{disp}}+\n"
"   E^{(20)}_{\\text{exch-disp}}\\end{aligned}"

msgid "No point group symmetry can be exploited in a SAPT calculation."
msgstr "\\ 在 SAPT 计算中无法利用点群对称性。"

msgid "DFT-SAPT"
msgstr "DFT-SAPT"

msgid ""
"It is of crucial importance to account for the *intra*\\ molecular "
"correlation effects of the individual SAPT terms since Hartree-Fock theory "
"often yields poor first- and second-order electrostatic properties. While "
"this can be done using many-body perturbation theory [1] (in a double "
"perturbation theory ansatz) a more efficient way is to use static and time-"
"dependent DFT theory. This variant of SAPT, termed as DFT-SAPT [2-6], has in"
" contrast to Hartree-Fock-SAPT the appealing feature that the polarisation "
"terms (:math:`E_{\\text{pol}}^{(1)}`, :math:`E_{\\text{ind}}^{(2)}`, "
":math:`E_{\\text{disp}}^{(2)}`) are potentially exact, i.e. they come out "
"exactly if the exact exchange-correlation (xc) potential and the exact "
"(frequency-dependent) xc response kernel of the monomers were known. On the "
"other hand, this does not hold for the exchange terms since Kohn-Sham theory"
" can at best give a good approximation to the exact density matrix of a "
"many-body system. It has been shown [6] that this is indeed the the case and"
" therefore DFT-SAPT has the potential to produce highly accurate interaction"
" energies comparable to high-level supermolecular many-body perturbation or "
"coupled cluster theory. However, in order to achieve this accuracy, it is of"
" crucial importance to correct the wrong asymptotic behaviour of the xc "
"potential in current DFT functionals [3-5]. This can be done by using e.g.:"
msgstr ""
"由于 Hartree-Fock 理论通常给出较差的一阶和二阶静电性质，因此考虑各个 SAPT 项的\\ *分子内*\\ "
"相关效应至关重要。虽然这可以使用多体微扰理论 [1]（在双重微扰理论拟设中）完成，但更有效的方法是使用静态和含时 DFT 理论。这种 SAPT 变体称为"
" DFT-SAPT [2-6]，与 Hartree-Fock-SAPT 相比，其吸引人的特点是极化项（\\ "
":math:`E_{\\text{pol}}^{(1)}`\\ 、\\ :math:`E_{\\text{ind}}^{(2)}`\\ 、\\ "
":math:`E_{\\text{disp}}^{(2)}`\\ ）是潜在精确的，即如果已知单体的精确交换相关（xc）势和精确（频率相关）xc "
"响应核，它们将精确得出。另一方面，这不适用于交换项，因为 Kohn-Sham 理论最多只能给出多体系统精确密度矩阵的良好近似。已经证明 [6] "
"情况确实如此，因此 DFT-SAPT 有潜力产生与高水平超分子多体微扰或耦合簇理论相媲美的高精度相互作用能。然而，为了实现这种精度，纠正当前 DFT "
"泛函中 xc 势的错误渐近行为至关重要 [3-5]。这可以通过使用例如："

msgid ""
"which activates the gradient-regulated asymptotic correction approach of "
"Grüning *et al.* (`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1327260>`__ "
"**114**, 652 (2001)) for the respective monomer calculation. The user has to"
" supply a ``shift`` parameter (:math:`\\Delta_{\\text{xc}}`) for the bulk "
"potential which should approximate the difference between the HOMO energy "
"(:math:`\\varepsilon_{\\text{HOMO}}`) obtained from the respective standard "
"Kohn-Sham calculation and the (negative) ionisation potential of the monomer"
" (:math:`\\mathrm{IP}`):"
msgstr ""
"这会激活 Grüning *等人*\\ 的梯度调节渐近校正方法（\\ `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.1327260>`__ **114**, 652 "
"(2001)）用于相应的单体计算。用户必须为体势提供一个 ``shift`` 参数（\\ :math:`\\Delta_{\\text{xc}}`\\ "
"），该参数应近似等于从相应标准 Kohn-Sham 计算获得的 HOMO 能量（\\ "
":math:`\\varepsilon_{\\text{HOMO}}`\\ ）与单体的（负）电离势（\\ :math:`\\mathrm{IP}`\\ "
"）之间的差值："

msgid "\\Delta_{\\text{xc}}=\\varepsilon_{\\text{HOMO}}-(-\\mathrm{IP})"
msgstr ""
"\\Delta_{\\text{xc}}=\\varepsilon_{\\text{HOMO}}-(-\\mathrm{IP})\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"This method accounts for the derivative discontinuity of the exact xc-"
"potential and that is missing in approximate ones. Note that this needs to "
"be done only once for each system. (See also section `DFT-SAPT calculation "
"of the NeAr dimer using the delta-HF correction <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#dft-sapt-calculation-of-the-"
"near-dimer-using-the-delta-hf-correction>`__ for an explicit example)."
msgstr ""
"该方法考虑了精确交换相关势的导数不连续性，而近似方法中缺少这一特性。请注意，每个体系只需执行一次此操作。（具体示例也可参见章节 `使用 delta-HF"
" 校正的 NeAr 二聚体 DFT-SAPT 计算 <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#dft-sapt-calculation-of-the-"
"near-dimer-using-the-delta-hf-correction>`__\\ ）。"

msgid "High order terms"
msgstr "高阶项"

msgid ""
"It has been found that third and higher-order terms become quite important "
"if one or both monomers are polar. As no higher than second-order terms are "
"currently implemented in SAPT, one may use a non-correlated estimation of "
"those terms by using supermolecular Hartree-Fock (see e.g. [7]). This can be"
" done by adapting the following template:"
msgstr ""
"研究发现，如果其中一个或两个单体是极性的，则三阶及更高阶项变得相当重要。由于目前 SAPT 中实现的项最高只到二阶，可以使用超分子 Hartree-"
"Fock 对这些项进行非相关估计（参见例如 [7]）。这可以通过调整以下模板来实现："

msgid "which stores the resulting :math:`\\delta`\\ (HF) term in ``dHF``."
msgstr "它将得到的 :math:`\\delta`\\ (HF) 项存储在 ``dHF`` 中。"

msgid ""
"Exchange interaction energies with infinite expansion in the intermolecular "
"overlap"
msgstr "分子间重叠无限展开的交换相互作用能"

msgid ""
"The exchange interaction energies are commonly expanded in powers of the "
"intermolecular overlap :math:`S`:"
msgstr "交换相互作用能通常按分子间重叠 :math:`S` 的幂次展开："

msgid ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^\\infty)&=&E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^2)+\\Delta E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^4)\n"
"     +\\Delta E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^6)\\dots \\\\\n"
"E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}(S^\\infty)&=&E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}(S^2)+\\Delta E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}(S^4)\n"
"      +\\Delta E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}(S^6)+\\dots \\\\\n"
"E_{\\text{exch-disp}}^{(2)}(S^\\infty)&=&E_{\\text{exch-disp}}^{(2)}(S^2)+\\Delta E_{\\text{exch-disp}}^{(2)}(S^4)\n"
"       +\\Delta E_{\\text{exch-disp}}^{(2)}(S^6)+\\dots \\\\\\end{aligned}"
msgstr ""
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^\\infty)&=&E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^2)+\\Delta E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^4)\n"
"     +\\Delta E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^6)\\dots \\\\\n"
"E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}(S^\\infty)&=&E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}(S^2)+\\Delta E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}(S^4)\n"
"      +\\Delta E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}(S^6)+\\dots \\\\\n"
"E_{\\text{exch-disp}}^{(2)}(S^\\infty)&=&E_{\\text{exch-disp}}^{(2)}(S^2)+\\Delta E_{\\text{exch-disp}}^{(2)}(S^4)\n"
"       +\\Delta E_{\\text{exch-disp}}^{(2)}(S^6)+\\dots \\\\\\end{aligned}"

msgid ""
"where :math:`E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^2)` corresponds to the exchange "
"interaction energy in which the intermolecular overlap occurs only in single"
" and quadratic powers and :math:`\\Delta E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^4)` "
"collects all terms up to the fourth power in :math:`S` excluding the terms "
"in :math:`E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^2)`. The above expansions are commonly "
"truncated after the first terms, leading to the so-called :math:`S^2` "
"approximation. Accordingly, for very small distances of the monomers, the "
"exchange interaction energies become inaccurate and eventually the "
":math:`S^2` approximation may even break down, see Refs. [10,11]."
msgstr ""
"\\ 其中 :math:`E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^2)` 对应于交换相互作用能，其中分子间重叠仅以一次和二次幂出现，而 "
":math:`\\Delta E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^4)` 收集了 :math:`S` 中直至四次幂的所有项，不包括 "
":math:`E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}(S^2)` 中的项。上述展开式通常在首项后被截断，导致所谓的 :math:`S^2` "
"近似。因此，对于单体间距离非常小的情况，交换相互作用能会变得不准确，最终 :math:`S^2` 近似甚至可能失效，参见文献 [10,11]。"

msgid ""
"While this problem may be circumvented by adding the :math:`\\delta`\\ (HF) "
"term to the SAPT interaction energy (see section `high order terms "
"<symmetry-adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#high-order-"
"terms>`__), a derivation of the infinite expansions of the first-order "
"exchange energy was given by Jeziorski, Bulski and Piela (*Int. J. Quantum "
"Chem.* **10** (1976) 281). More recently, formulas for the second-order "
"exchange induction and dispersion energies were derived by Schäffer and "
"Jansen, see Refs. [10,11]."
msgstr ""
"虽然这个问题可以通过将 :math:`\\delta`\\ (HF) 项添加到 SAPT 相互作用能中来规避（参见 `高阶项 <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#high-order-terms>`__ 一节），但 "
"Jeziorski、Bulski 和 Piela 给出了对一阶交换能进行无穷级数展开的推导（\\ *Int. J. Quantum Chem.* "
"**10** (1976) 281）。最近，Schäffer 和 Jansen 推导了二阶交换诱导能和交换色散能的公式，参见文献 [10,11]。"

msgid ""
"In Molpro, the calculation of the exchange interaction energies in the "
":math:`S^2` approximation or with an infinite expansion in :math:`S` "
"(:math:`S^\\infty`) can be controlled through the switch"
msgstr ""
"在 Molpro 中，交换相互作用能在 :math:`S^2` 近似下或使用 :math:`S` 的无穷级数展开 (:math:`S^\\infty`)"
" 的计算可以通过开关控制"

msgid ""
"where ``sinf=0`` will calculate the exchange interaction energies within the"
" :math:`S^2` approximation and ``sinf=1`` calls the routines to calculate "
"all exchange interaction terms with infinite overlap expansion "
"(:math:`S^\\infty`). Using ``sinf=2`` will calculate both the :math:`S^2` "
"and the :math:`S^\\infty` contributions. Note that the first-order exchange "
"energy is always calculated in both variants."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``sinf=0`` 将在 :math:`S^2` 近似内计算交换相互作用能，而 ``sinf=1`` 调用例程以无穷重叠展开 "
"(:math:`S^\\infty`) 计算所有交换相互作用项。使用 ``sinf=2`` 将同时计算 :math:`S^2` 和 "
":math:`S^\\infty` 贡献。请注意，一阶交换能总是以两种变体计算。"

msgid "Using exact exchange Kohn-Sham response kernels"
msgstr "使用精确交换 Kohn-Sham 响应核"

msgid ""
"The exact exchange Kohn-Sham response kernel can be used in the computations"
" of the second order (exchange-)induction and (exchange-)dispersion "
"contributions, see Ref. [9]. In order to do so, the :math:`\\langle "
"i|v_x^{\\text{NL}}-v_x|j\\rangle` matrix elements have to be precomputed for"
" each monomer and supplied to the SAPT program. The following input template"
" shows how to compute DFT-SAPT interaction energy contributions using the "
"(A)TDEXX response kernels and the LPBE0AC xc potentials (cf section "
"`optimised Effective Potential (OEP) method "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#optimised-effective-potential-oep-"
"method>`__):"
msgstr ""
"精确交换 Kohn-Sham 响应核可用于二阶（交换）诱导和（交换）色散贡献的计算，参见文献 [9]。为此，必须为每个单体预先计算 "
":math:`\\langle i|v_x^{\\text{NL}}-v_x|j\\rangle` 矩阵元，并提供给 SAPT "
"程序。以下输入模板展示了如何使用 (A)TDEXX 响应核和 LPBE0AC xc 势计算 DFT-SAPT 相互作用能贡献（参见 `优化有效势 "
"(OEP) 方法 <the_density_functional_program.html#optimised-effective-potential-"
"oep-method>`__ 一节）："

msgid ""
"The input parameter ``TDEXXMODE`` takes the values 1 or 2. With "
"``TDEXXMODE=1`` the full nonadiabatic TDEXX response kernel and with "
"``TDEXXMODE=2`` only the adiabatic TDEXX response kernel is used in the "
"calculation of the response matrices of the monomers. Notice also from the "
"above template that it is important to set ``nlexfac=1.0`` which sets the "
"scaling factor of exact exchange in the SAPT program. If ``nlexfac`` is set "
"to a value lower than one, a hybrid ALDA-TDEXX kernel will be used in the "
"calculation. All reported calculations using this program should cite Ref. "
"[9]."
msgstr ""
"输入参数 ``TDEXXMODE`` 取值为 1 或 2。使用 ``TDEXXMODE=1`` 时，在单体响应矩阵的计算中使用完全非绝热 TDEXX "
"响应核；使用 ``TDEXXMODE=2`` 时，仅使用绝热 TDEXX 响应核。另请注意，从上述模板可以看出，设置 ``nlexfac=1.0`` "
"非常重要，它设定了 SAPT 程序中精确交换的标度因子。如果 ``nlexfac`` 设置为小于 1 的值，则在计算中将使用混合 ALDA-TDEXX "
"核。所有使用此程序报告的计算都应引用文献 [9]。"

msgid ""
"Note that unlike in the conventional hybrid-DFT case, DFT-SAPT calculations "
"can be performed also using density fitting techniques for (A)TDEXX kernels "
"with Molpro. A corresponding efficient DF implementation which works in "
"conjunction with (A)TDEXX kernels is the DFSAPT program, see section "
"`DFSAPT: a density-fitting DFT-SAPT program for arbitrary monomer basis sets"
" <symmetry-adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#dfsapt-a-density-"
"fitting-dft-sapt-program-for-arbitrary-monomer-basis-sets>`__."
msgstr ""
"请注意，与传统的杂化DFT情况不同，使用Molpro也可以对(A)TDEXX核采用密度拟合技术进行DFT-"
"SAPT计算。一个与(A)TDEXX核协同工作的相应高效DF实现是DFSAPT程序，参见章节 `DFSAPT: a density-fitting "
"DFT-SAPT program for arbitrary monomer basis sets <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#dfsapt-a-density-fitting-"
"dft-sapt-program-for-arbitrary-monomer-basis-sets>`__\\ 。"

msgid "SAPT with regularised nuclear attraction integrals"
msgstr "使用正则化核吸引积分的SAPT"

msgid ""
"The SAPT expansion of the intermolecular interaction energy does not yield "
"the charge-transfer (CT) interaction energy as a separate term, rather it is"
" included in the sum of the second-order induction and exchange-induction "
"energies:"
msgstr "分子间相互作用能的SAPT展开式并未将电荷转移（CT）相互作用能作为一个单独的项给出，而是将其包含在二阶诱导能和交换-诱导能之和中："

msgid ""
"E_{\\text{int}}^{\\text{CT}} \\subset E_{\\text{ind}}^{(2)}+E_{\\text{exch-"
"ind}}^{(2)}"
msgstr ""
"E_{\\text{int}}^{\\text{CT}} \\subset E_{\\text{ind}}^{(2)}+E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"Due to Misquitta, see Ref. [12], the CT interaction energy can, however, be "
"’estimated’ by using a regularised nuclear attraction potential for the "
"monomers in order to calculate (exchange-)induction energies excluding the "
"(short-ranged) CT interaction contribution. The CT interaction energy can "
"then be obtained by calculating the difference between the full "
"(exchange-)induction interaction energy and the (exchange-)induction "
"interaction energy as obtained by the regularised SAPT method:"
msgstr ""
"然而，根据Misquitta的研究（参见文献[12]），可以通过对单体使用正则化的核吸引势来计算（交换-）诱导能，从而排除（短程的）CT相互作用贡献，以此来'估算'CT相互作用能。然后，通过计算完整的（交换-）诱导相互作用能与正则化SAPT方法得到的（交换-）诱导相互作用能之间的差值，即可获得CT相互作用能："

msgid ""
"E_{\\text{int}}^{\\text{CT}} \\approx\n"
"      E_{\\text{ind}}^{(2)}+E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}\n"
"      -E_{\\text{ind}}^{(2)}[regul]-E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}[regul]"
msgstr ""
"E_{\\text{int}}^{\\text{CT}} \\approx\n"
"      E_{\\text{ind}}^{(2)}+E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}\n"
"      -E_{\\text{ind}}^{(2)}[regul]-E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}[regul]"

msgid ""
"For obtaining regularised nuclear attraction integrals Misquitta proposes "
"the form [12]:"
msgstr "为了获得正则化的核吸引积分，Misquitta提出了以下形式[12]："

msgid "V_{\\text{regul}}=\\frac{1}{r}\\Big(1-e^{-\\alpha r^2}\\Big)"
msgstr ""
"V_{\\text{regul}}=\\frac{1}{r}\\Big(1-e^{-\\alpha r^2}\\Big)\n"
"\n"

msgid "with :math:`\\alpha=3.0`."
msgstr "其中 :math:`\\alpha=3.0`\\ 。"

msgid ""
"In Molpro, regularised SAPT calculations can be performed by calling the "
"``vreg`` module ’before’ saving the monomer geometries with ``{sapt; "
"monomerA,B}``. An input template for the calculation of the CT interaction "
"energy is given by:"
msgstr ""
"在 Molpro 中，可以通过在保存单体几何结构之前调用 ``vreg`` 模块（使用 ``{sapt; monomerA,B}``\\ ）来执行正则化"
" SAPT 计算。用于计算 CT 相互作用能的输入模板如下："

msgid "The ``vreg`` module accepts the following options:"
msgstr "``vreg`` 模块接受以下选项："

msgid "``ALPHA`` Exponent of the exponential function of the damping factor."
msgstr "``ALPHA`` 阻尼因子指数函数的指数。"

msgid "``NQ`` Global exponent of the damping factor (type: integer)."
msgstr "``NQ`` 阻尼因子的全局指数（类型：整数）。"

msgid ""
"``SAVE`` Record (``record.file``) in which to save the integrals. If not "
"used, the standard record that holds the nuclear attraction integrals is "
"overwritten."
msgstr "``SAVE`` 用于保存积分的记录（\\ ``record.file``\\ ）。如果未使用，则覆盖保存核吸引积分的标准记录。"

msgid ""
"The regularised SAPT can also be used in order to resolve the breakdown of "
"the conventional SAPT expansion for the interaction between heavy atoms, "
"see, e.g., Liu *et al.*, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct200243s>`__ **7**, 2399 (2011). A regularised "
"SAPT method was, e.g., used in T. Clark, A. Heßelmann, `Phys. Chem. Chem. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/C8CP03079K>`__ **20**, 22849 (2018) for "
"calculating the bonding between carbon tetrahalides and halide anions. Note "
"that in this case the addition of the :math:`\\delta`\\ (HF) term (see "
"section `high order terms <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#high-order-terms>`__) for "
"taking into account short-ranged polarisation effects is crucial."
msgstr ""
"正则化 SAPT 也可用于解决传统 SAPT 展开在重原子间相互作用时的失效问题，参见，例如，Liu 等人，\\ `J. Chem. Theory "
"Comput. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/ct200243s>`__ **7**, 2399 (2011)。例如，正则化 "
"SAPT 方法在 T. Clark, A. Heßelmann, `Phys. Chem. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1039/C8CP03079K>`__ **20**, 22849 (2018) "
"中被用于计算碳四卤化物与卤化物阴离子之间的键合。请注意，在这种情况下，添加 :math:`\\delta`\\ (HF) 项（参见章节 `高阶项 "
"<symmetry-adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#high-order-"
"terms>`__\\ ）以考虑短程极化效应至关重要。"

msgid "Density fitting"
msgstr "密度拟合"

msgid ""
"In order to be able to study interactions between extended monomers one can "
"use density fitting to approximate the integrals in SAPT [7]. For this one "
"may use the input:"
msgstr "为了能够研究扩展单体间的相互作用，可以使用密度拟合来近似SAPT中的积分[7]。为此，可以使用以下输入："

msgid ""
"New density fitting routines for the calculation of "
":math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{IND}}(S^\\infty)` and "
":math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{DISP}}(S^\\infty)` can be activated with the switch"
msgstr ""
"用于计算 :math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{IND}}(S^\\infty)` 和 "
":math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{DISP}}(S^\\infty)` 的新密度拟合例程可以通过开关激活"

msgid ""
"For performing density-fitting DFT-SAPT calculations with arbitrary monomer "
"basis sets see section `DFSAPT: a density-fitting DFT-SAPT program for "
"arbitrary monomer basis sets <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#dfsapt-a-density-fitting-"
"dft-sapt-program-for-arbitrary-monomer-basis-sets>`__."
msgstr ""
"对于使用任意单体基组进行密度拟合DFT-SAPT计算，请参见 `DFSAPT：适用于任意单体基组的密度拟合DFT-SAPT程序 <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#dfsapt-a-density-fitting-"
"dft-sapt-program-for-arbitrary-monomer-basis-sets>`__ 一节。"

msgid "SAPT with ECP’s"
msgstr "使用有效芯势的SAPT"

msgid ""
"If effective core potentials (ECP’s) are used in the monomer calculations, "
"it is important to add the :math:`\\delta`\\ (HF) term to the SAPT "
"interaction energy (see K. Patkowski, K. Szalewicz, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2784391>`__ **127**, 164103 (2007)). For "
"examples for the calculation of :math:`\\delta`\\ (HF) see sections `high "
"order terms <symmetry-adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#high-"
"order-terms>`__ and `examples <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#examples>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果在单体计算中使用了有效芯势（ECP），则必须在SAPT相互作用能中加入 :math:`\\delta`\\ (HF) 项（参见 K. "
"Patkowski, K. Szalewicz, `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.2784391>`__ **127**, 164103 (2007)）。关于计算 "
":math:`\\delta`\\ (HF) 的示例，请参见 `高阶项 <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#high-order-terms>`__ 和 `示例 "
"<symmetry-adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#examples>`__ 两节。"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "HF-SAPT calculation of the H2O dimer using the delta-HF correction"
msgstr "使用 delta-HF 校正的 H2O 二聚体的 HF-SAPT 计算"

msgid "DFT-SAPT calculation of the NeAr dimer using the delta-HF correction"
msgstr "使用 delta-HF 校正的 NeAr 二聚体的 DFT-SAPT 计算"

msgid ""
"DF-DFT-SAPT calculation of the NeAr dimer using the delta-HF correction"
msgstr "使用 delta-HF 校正的 NeAr 二聚体的 DF-DFT-SAPT 计算"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "选项"

msgid ""
"``SAPT_LEVEL`` Set to 1 for first-order terms (:math:`E_{\\text{pol}}^{(1)}`"
" and :math:`E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}`), to 2 for additional second order "
"(exchange-)induction terms (:math:`E_{\\text{ind}}^{(2)}` and "
":math:`E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}`) and 3 for all first- and second-order "
"terms (including then also :math:`E_{\\text{disp}}^{(2)}` and "
":math:`E_{\\text{exch-disp}}^{(2)}`) (default 3)"
msgstr ""
"``SAPT_LEVEL`` 设置为 1 用于一阶项（\\ :math:`E_{\\text{pol}}^{(1)}` 和 "
":math:`E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}`\\ ），设置为 2 用于额外的二阶（交换-）诱导项（\\ "
":math:`E_{\\text{ind}}^{(2)}` 和 :math:`E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}`\\ ），设置为 3"
" 用于所有一阶和二阶项（此时也包括 :math:`E_{\\text{disp}}^{(2)}` 和 :math:`E_{\\text{exch-"
"disp}}^{(2)}`\\ ）（默认值 3）"

msgid ""
"``SINF`` Set to 0 to calculate exchange interaction energies within the "
":math:`S^2` approximation and to 1 for calculating all exchange terms with "
"an infinite overlap expansion (default 1)."
msgstr ""
"``SINF`` 设置为 0 以在 :math:`S^2` 近似内计算交换相互作用能，设置为 1 以使用无限重叠展开计算所有交换项（默认值 1）。"

msgid ""
"``SAPT_FITLEVEL`` Level of density fitting approximations in SAPT which can "
"have values 0 to 3 (default 0)"
msgstr "``SAPT_FITLEVEL`` SAPT 中密度拟合近似的级别，可取值为 0 到 3（默认值 0）"

msgid ""
"``SAPT_ICPKS`` Switch between iterative (=1) and non-iterative (=0) solution"
" of coupled-perturbed Kohn-Sham equations (default 0)"
msgstr "``SAPT_ICPKS`` 在耦合微扰 Kohn-Sham 方程的迭代（=1）和非迭代（=0）解法之间切换（默认值 0）"

msgid ""
"``SAPT_CPKSTHR`` Threshold for density matrix convergency in the coupled-"
"perturbed Kohn-Sham program (default 1.d-6)."
msgstr "``SAPT_CPKSTHR`` 耦合微扰Kohn-Sham程序中密度矩阵收敛的阈值（默认值 1.d-6）。"

msgid ""
"``SAPT_CPKMAXIT`` Maximum number of iterations in the coupled-perturbed "
"Kohn-Sham program (default 50)."
msgstr "``SAPT_CPKMAXIT`` 耦合微扰Kohn-Sham程序中的最大迭代次数（默认值 50）。"

msgid ""
"``SAPT_FROZENA`` Number of frozen electrons in the response calculations for"
" monomer A (default 0)"
msgstr "``SAPT_FROZENA`` 单体A响应计算中的冻结电子数（默认值 0）"

msgid ""
"``SAPT_NFRQ_DISP`` Number of frequencies for the Casimir-Polder integration "
"(default 10)"
msgstr "``SAPT_NFRQ_DISP`` Casimir-Polder积分所用的频率数（默认值 10）"

msgid ""
"``SAPT_NORM_DISP`` Norm for the density fitting which can be either "
"``COULOMB`` or ``NATURAL`` (default ``COULOMB``)"
msgstr ""
"``SAPT_NORM_DISP`` 密度拟合的范数，可以是 ``COULOMB`` 或 ``NATURAL``\\ （默认 ``COULOMB``\\"
" ）"

msgid ""
"``SAPT_DISP_N4`` Can speedup the calculation of the dispersion energy by "
":math:`N^4` scaling (default 1)"
msgstr "``SAPT_DISP_N4`` 可通过 :math:`N^4` 标度加速色散能的计算（默认值 1）"

msgid ""
"``THR_XCKERN`` Density threshold for the xc kernel matrix elements (default "
"1.d-8)"
msgstr "``THR_XCKERN`` xc 核矩阵元的密度阈值（默认 1.d-8）"

msgid "``FIT_XCKERN`` Fit both sides of the xc kernel (default 0)"
msgstr "``FIT_XCKERN`` 拟合 xc 核的两侧（默认 0）"

msgid ""
"``SAPT_DISK`` If 0 write all dimer amplitudes to file, if 1 write 3-index "
"response propagators to file and if 2 write 3-index response propagators "
"compressed to file. The latter two variants save disk space but need more "
"CPU time to compute :math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{exch-disp}}` (default 0)"
msgstr ""
"``SAPT_DISK`` 如果为 0，将所有二聚体振幅写入文件；如果为 1，将三中心响应传播子写入文件；如果为 "
"2，将压缩后的三中心响应传播子写入文件。后两种变体能节省磁盘空间，但需要更多 CPU 时间来计算 "
":math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{exch-disp}}`\\ （默认 0）"

msgid ""
"``COMPRESS_THR`` If ``SAPT_DISK``\\ =2 this value determines the compression"
" cutoff (default 1d-12)"
msgstr "``COMPRESS_THR`` 如果 ``SAPT_DISK``\\ =2，此值决定压缩截断值（默认 1d-12）"

msgid "``CFAC`` factor for VWN correlation in ALDA xc-kernel (default 1.d0)"
msgstr "``CFAC`` ALDA xc-核中 VWN 相关的因子（默认 1.d0）"

msgid ""
"``SAPT_QUAD`` quadrature type in frequency integration (0: Chebyshev, 1: "
"Gauss-Legendre (default))"
msgstr "``SAPT_QUAD`` 频率积分中的求积类型 (0: Chebyshev, 1: 高斯-勒让德求积（默认）)"

msgid "``W0`` parameter in Gauss-Legendre quadrature (default 2.d0)"
msgstr "``W0`` 高斯-勒让德求积中的参数（默认 2.d0）"

msgid ""
"``GRIDTHR`` Threshold for grid accuracy in some routines which generate xc-"
"kernel integrals."
msgstr "``GRIDTHR`` 某些生成 xc 核积分的程序中网格精度的阈值。"

msgid ""
"``THRDUM`` Threshold for density calculated at dummy function gridpoints "
"(which can serve as a singularity correction for the calculation of the XC "
"kernel matrix) (default: ``1d-12``)."
msgstr "``THRDUM`` 在虚拟函数网格点上计算的密度阈值（可作为计算 XC 核矩阵时的奇点校正）（默认：\\ ``1d-12``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``LSING`` Singularity correction for XC kernel matrix (default: ``.false.``)"
msgstr "``LSING`` XC 核矩阵的奇点校正（默认：\\ ``.false.``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``DF2`` Logical switch for new DF routines. Note that with ``DF2=.true.`` "
"the exchange interaction contributions are only calculated without the "
"single-exchange approximation. (default: ``.false.``)"
msgstr ""
"``DF2`` 新 DF 程序的逻辑开关。注意，当 ``DF2=.true.`` 时，交换相互作用贡献仅在不使用单交换近似的情况下计算。（默认：\\ "
"``.false.``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``DF2MOD`` Controls calculation mode of :math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{DISP}}`: with"
" ``DF2MOD=0`` all 3idx integrals are calculated and stored on disk in "
"advance. In case of ``DF2MOD=1`` this is done in two subsequent steps at the"
" expense, however, of the fact that then the amplitudes have to be "
"constructed twice. (default: ``0``)"
msgstr ""
"``DF2MOD`` 控制 :math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{DISP}}` 的计算模式：当 ``DF2MOD=0`` 时，所有 3idx "
"积分均预先计算并存储在磁盘上。当 ``DF2MOD=1`` 时，这分两步完成，但代价是振幅需要构造两次。（默认：\\ ``0``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``X0THR`` SVD threshold for inversion of :math:`\\chi_0` if EXX kernel used "
"(default: ``1d-8``)"
msgstr "``X0THR`` 若使用 EXX 核，则用于 :math:`\\chi_0` 求逆的 SVD 阈值（默认：\\ ``1d-8``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``NAUX_MAX`` Maximal length of auxiliary function batches in EXX kernel "
"routine (default: ``50``)."
msgstr "``NAUX_MAX`` EXX 核程序中辅助函数批次的最大长度（默认：\\ ``50``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``PVVDISK`` Write :math:`(P|ab)` ints to disk in EXX kernel calculation. "
"This can speed up the calculation on the expense of the disk space "
"requirements (scaling as: :math:`N_{\\text{aux}}^A` :math:`\\times "
"N_{\\text{vir}}^A` :math:`\\times (N_{\\text{vir}}^A+1)/2` "
":math:`+N_{\\text{aux}}^B` :math:`\\times N_{\\text{vir}}^B` :math:`\\times "
"(N_{\\text{vir}}^B+1)/2` (default=\\ ``.false.``)."
msgstr ""
"``PVVDISK`` 在 EXX 核计算中将 :math:`(P|ab)` 积分写入磁盘。这可以加快计算速度，但代价是磁盘空间需求（按比例：\\ "
":math:`N_{\\text{aux}}^A` :math:`\\times N_{\\text{vir}}^A` :math:`\\times "
"(N_{\\text{vir}}^A+1)/2` :math:`+N_{\\text{aux}}^B` :math:`\\times "
"N_{\\text{vir}}^B` :math:`\\times (N_{\\text{vir}}^B+1)/2` （默认=\\ "
"``.false.``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"The last threshold values for the 2- and 3-index integrals should not be set"
" higher in density fitting calculations as this can cause lower accuracies "
"in the interaction terms. In addition SAPT knows the following subcommands:"
msgstr "在密度拟合计算中，不应将二中心和三中心积分的最终阈值设置得过高，因为这可能导致相互作用项精度降低。此外，SAPT 还支持以下子命令："

msgid ""
"``MONOMERA`` Stores informations (like number of electrons, etc.) about "
"previous monomer A calculation"
msgstr "``MONOMERA`` 存储先前单体 A 计算的信息（如电子数等）"

msgid "``MONOMERB`` See above"
msgstr "``MONOMERB`` 同上"

msgid "``INTERMOL`` Starts the SAPT calculation"
msgstr "``INTERMOL`` 启动 SAPT 计算"

msgid "``CA`` Record number of wave function for monomer A (always needed)"
msgstr "``CA`` 单体 A 的波函数记录号（始终需要）"

msgid "``CB`` Record number of wave function for monomer B (always needed)"
msgstr "``CB`` 单体 B 的波函数记录号（始终需要）"

msgid "``SAPTLEVEL`` See above"
msgstr "``SAPTLEVEL`` 同上"

msgid "``FITLEVEL`` See above"
msgstr "``FITLEVEL`` 同上"

msgid "``ICPKS`` See above"
msgstr "``ICPKS`` 同上"

msgid "``FROZA`` See above"
msgstr "``FROZA`` 同上"

msgid "``FROZB`` See above"
msgstr "``FROZB`` 同上"

msgid ""
"``NLEXFAC`` Amount of nonlocal exact exchange in hybrid DFT-SAPT "
"calculations"
msgstr "``NLEXFAC`` 混合DFT-SAPT计算中非局域精确交换的量"

msgid ""
"``CPKSTHR`` Threshold for density matrix convergency in the coupled-"
"perturbed Kohn-Sham program."
msgstr "``CPKSTHR`` 耦合微扰Kohn-Sham程序中密度矩阵收敛的阈值。"

msgid ""
"``CPKSMAXIT`` Maximum number of iterations in the coupled-perturbed Kohn-"
"Sham program."
msgstr "``CPKSMAXIT`` 耦合微扰Kohn-Sham程序中的最大迭代次数。"

msgid ""
"DFSAPT: a density-fitting DFT-SAPT program for arbitrary monomer basis sets"
msgstr "DFSAPT：一个适用于任意单体基组的密度拟合DFT-SAPT程序"

msgid ""
"DFSAPT is an alternative density-fitting DFT-SAPT program which works with "
"arbitrary monomer basis sets and which can be used for extended dimer "
"systems of about 800 electrons, see Ref.[8]."
msgstr "DFSAPT 是一个替代的密度拟合DFT-SAPT程序，它适用于任意的单体基组，并且可用于约800个电子的扩展二聚体体系，参见文献[8]。"

msgid ""
"A corresponding calculation, in which the water monomers are calculated in "
"their own local basis set (monomer centered basis set calculation) is "
"presented in `DFSAPT calculation of the water dimer using an MCBS basis set "
"<symmetry-adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#dfsapt-"
"calculation-of-the-water-dimer-using-an-mcbs-basis-set>`__. Note, however, "
"that very large basis sets are required to converge the individual "
"interaction energy contributions. In order to improve the basis set "
"convergence, additional midbond functions can be added as is exemplified in "
"`DFSAPT calculation of the water dimer using an MC+BS basis set <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#dfsapt-calculation-of-the-"
"water-dimer-using-an-mc-bs-basis-set>`__. Here the def2-TZVP basis functions"
" for the Neon atom were positioned in between the O\\ :math:`\\cdots`\\ H "
"hydrogen bridge."
msgstr ""
"一个相应的计算，其中水单体在其自身的局部基组（单体中心基组计算）中进行计算，展示在\\ `使用MCBS基组计算水二聚体的DFSAPT "
"<symmetry-adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#dfsapt-"
"calculation-of-the-water-dimer-using-an-mcbs-basis-set>`__\\ "
"中。但请注意，需要非常大的基组才能收敛各个相互作用能贡献。为了改善基组收敛性，可以添加额外的中键函数，如\\ "
"`使用MC+BS基组计算水二聚体的DFSAPT <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#dfsapt-calculation-of-the-"
"water-dimer-using-an-mc-bs-basis-set>`__\\ 中的示例所示。此处，氖原子的def2-TZVP基函数被放置在O\\"
" :math:`\\cdots`\\ H氢桥之间。"

msgid ""
"A complete (DCBS) DFSAPT calculation with additional :math:`\\delta`\\ (HF) "
"correction and using the PBE0AC(BRJ) xc potential (with automatic asymptotic"
" correction) is shown in section `DFSAPT calculation of the water dimer with"
" additional d(HF) correction <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#dfsapt-calculation-of-the-"
"water-dimer-with-additional-d-hf-correction>`__."
msgstr ""
"一个完整的（DCBS）DFSAPT计算，包含额外的 :math:`\\delta`\\ (HF) 校正并使用PBE0AC(BRJ) "
"xc势（具有自动渐近校正），展示在章节\\ `使用额外d(HF)校正计算水二聚体的DFSAPT <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#dfsapt-calculation-of-the-"
"water-dimer-with-additional-d-hf-correction>`__\\ 中。"

msgid ""
"Note that in contrast to the DFT-SAPT/DF-DFT-SAPT programs the exchange-"
"dispersion energy is not calculated on the coupled level. Instead, the "
"coupled :math:`E^{(2)}_{exch-disp}` energies are estimated by scaling the "
"uncoupled ones with a factor which has been obtained from a linear fit to "
"exact results, see Ref.[8]."
msgstr ""
"请注意，与DFT-SAPT/DF-DFT-SAPT程序不同，交换-色散能不是在耦合水平上计算的。相反，耦合的 :math:`E^{(2)}_{exch-"
"disp}` 能是通过将非耦合的能乘以一个从与精确结果的线性拟合中获得的因子来估算的，参见文献[8]。"

msgid ""
"The following list shows all options which can be used with the DFSAPT "
"program:"
msgstr "以下列表显示了可与DFSAPT程序一起使用的所有选项："

msgid "``E1P`` Calculate :math:`E^{(1)}_{pol}` (default: ``1``)."
msgstr "``E1P`` 计算 :math:`E^{(1)}_{pol}`\\ （默认值：\\ ``1``\\ ）。"

msgid "``E1X`` Calculate :math:`E^{(1)}_{exch}` (default: ``1``)."
msgstr "``E1X`` 计算 :math:`E^{(1)}_{exch}`\\ （默认值：\\ ``1``\\ ）。"

msgid "``E2I`` Calculate :math:`E^{(2)}_{ind}` (default: ``0``)."
msgstr "``E2I`` 计算 :math:`E^{(2)}_{ind}`\\ （默认值：\\ ``0``\\ ）。"

msgid "``E2XI`` Calculate :math:`E^{(2)}_{exch-ind}` (default: ``0``)."
msgstr "``E2XI`` 计算 :math:`E^{(2)}_{exch-ind}`\\ （默认值：\\ ``0``\\ ）。"

msgid "``E2D`` Calculate :math:`E^{(2)}_{disp}` (default: ``0``)."
msgstr "``E2D`` 计算 :math:`E^{(2)}_{disp}`\\ （默认值：\\ ``0``\\ ）。"

msgid "``E2XD`` Calculate :math:`E^{(2)}_{exch-disp}` (default: ``0``)."
msgstr "``E2XD`` 计算 :math:`E^{(2)}_{exch-disp}`\\ （默认值：\\ ``0``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``ALL`` Calculate all SAPT contributions (up to 2nd order) (default: ``0``)."
msgstr "``ALL`` 计算所有 SAPT 贡献（至二阶）（默认值：\\ ``0``\\ ）。"

msgid "``AUXBAS`` Auxiliary basis set (default: ``MP2FIT``)."
msgstr "``AUXBAS`` 辅助基组（默认值：\\ ``MP2FIT``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``NFREQ`` Number of frequencies for computing the monomer response matrices "
"(default: ``10``)."
msgstr "``NFREQ`` 用于计算单体响应矩阵的频率数量（默认值：\\ ``10``\\ ）。"

msgid "``GRIDTHR`` Threshold for grid accuracy (default: ``1d-10``)."
msgstr "``GRIDTHR`` 格点精度阈值（默认值：\\ ``1d-10``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``THRKERN`` Threshold for density in xc kernel calculation (default: "
"``1d-12``)."
msgstr "``THRKERN`` xc 核计算中的密度阈值（默认值：\\ ``1d-12``\\ ）。"

msgid "``PRINT`` Print flag (default: ``0``)."
msgstr "``PRINT`` 打印标志（默认值：\\ ``0``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``W0`` Value effects Gauss-Legendre quadrature for computing the response "
"function (see Amos,Handy,Knowles,Rice,Stone,\\ *J. Phys.Chem.* **89** (1985)"
" 2186) (default: ``2d0``)"
msgstr ""
"``W0`` 影响用于计算响应函数的高斯-勒让德求积的值（参见 Amos,Handy,Knowles,Rice,Stone,\\ *J. "
"Phys.Chem.* **89** (1985) 2186）（默认值：\\ ``2d0``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``FEXX`` Exact exchange factor in response calculations (default: ``0d0``)."
msgstr "``FEXX`` 响应计算中的精确交换因子（默认值：\\ ``0d0``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``FXC`` Exchange-correlation factor in response calculations (default: "
"``0d0``)."
msgstr "``FXC`` 响应计算中的交换-相关因子（默认值：\\ ``0d0``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``FCOUL`` Coulomb contribution factor in response calculations (default: "
"``1d0``)."
msgstr "``FCOUL`` 响应计算中的库仑贡献因子（默认值：\\ ``1d0``\\ ）。"

msgid "``XFAC`` Exchange factor in XC kernel (default: ``1d0``)."
msgstr "``XFAC`` XC 核中的交换因子（默认值：\\ ``1d0``\\ ）。"

msgid "``CFAC`` Correlation factor in XC kernel (default: ``1d0``)."
msgstr "``CFAC`` XC 核中的相关因子（默认值：\\ ``1d0``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``AUXMAX`` Maximum block size of auxiliary function space for three-index "
"integrals of the type (aux\\ :math:`|`\\ orb.orb) (default: ``50``)."
msgstr ""
"``AUXMAX`` 用于 (aux\\ :math:`|`\\ orb.orb) 类型三中心积分的辅助函数空间最大块大小（默认值：\\ "
"``50``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``MOMAX`` Maximum block size of orbital function space for three-index "
"integrals of the type (orb\\ :math:`|`\\ orb.aux) (default: ``50``)."
msgstr ""
"``MOMAX`` 用于 (orb\\ :math:`|`\\ orb.aux) 类型三中心积分的轨道函数空间最大块大小（默认值：\\ ``50``\\"
" ）。"

msgid ""
"``FXCSING`` Singularity correction for XC kernel matrix (default: ``0``)"
msgstr "``FXCSING`` XC 核矩阵的奇点校正（默认值：\\ ``0``\\ ）"

msgid ""
"``THRDUM`` Threshold for density calculated at dummy function gridpoints "
"(which can serve as a singularity correction for the calculation of the XC "
"kernel matrix) (default: ``1d-4``)."
msgstr "``THRDUM`` 虚拟函数格点上计算的密度阈值（可作为计算 XC 核矩阵时的奇点校正）（默认值：\\ ``1d-4``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``COMP`` Write 3-index integrals compressed to disk (to save disk space) "
"(default: ``0``)."
msgstr "``COMP`` 将三中心积分压缩后写入磁盘（以节省磁盘空间）（默认值：\\ ``0``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``THRC`` Threshold for 3-index integral calculations (integrals which are "
"smaller than the given threshold are not written to disk) (default: "
"``1d-10``)."
msgstr "``THRC`` 三中心积分计算的阈值（小于给定阈值的积分不写入磁盘）（默认值：\\ ``1d-10``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``MODE`` Switch for alternative DFSAPT driver which can use integral "
"compression (to be evoked by ``MODE=2``) (default: ``1``)."
msgstr "``MODE`` 替代DFSAPT驱动器的开关，可使用积分压缩（通过\\ ``MODE=2``\\ 调用）（默认值：\\ ``1``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``FXCFIT`` Use density fitting for computation of XC contributions in CPKS "
"calculation (default: ``0``)."
msgstr "``FXCFIT`` 在CPKS计算中使用密度拟合计算XC贡献（默认值：\\ ``0``\\ ）。"

msgid "``CPKS`` Switch for different CPKS solvers (default: ``1``)."
msgstr "``CPKS`` 不同CPKS求解器的开关（默认值：\\ ``1``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``THRCG`` Threshold for CG/GMRES solver in CPKS calculations (default: "
"``1d-8``)."
msgstr "``THRCG`` CPKS计算中CG/GMRES求解器的阈值（默认值：\\ ``1d-8``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``NSYSOLVE`` Switch for BiCG (``NSYSOLVE=1``) or GMRES (``NSYSOLVE=2``) "
"solver in CPKS calculations (default: ``2``)."
msgstr ""
"``NSYSOLVE`` CPKS计算中BiCG（\\ ``NSYSOLVE=1``\\ ）或GMRES（\\ ``NSYSOLVE=2``\\ "
"）求解器的开关（默认值：\\ ``2``\\ ）。"

msgid "``NSUB`` Subspace size in GMRES solver (default: ``50``)."
msgstr "``NSUB`` GMRES 求解器中的子空间大小（默认值：\\ ``50``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``T678`` Switch for 3 different computation modes for :math:`E^{(2)}_{exch-"
"disp}`. ``T678=3`` is recommended for the calculation of large systems but "
"requires more disk space to store intermediate quantities (default: ``1``)."
msgstr ""
"``T678`` 用于 :math:`E^{(2)}_{exch-disp}` 的 3 种不同计算模式的开关。\\ ``T678=3`` "
"推荐用于大体系的计算，但需要更多磁盘空间来存储中间量（默认值：\\ ``1``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"``TDEXX`` set to 1 for using the adiabatic TDEXX kernel and to 2 for using "
"the nonadiabatic TDEXX kernel"
msgstr "``TDEXX`` 设置为 1 表示使用绝热 TDEXX 核，设置为 2 表示使用非绝热 TDEXX 核"

msgid "``TDEXXFAC`` prefactor for TDEXX response kernel"
msgstr "``TDEXXFAC`` TDEXX 响应核的预因子"

msgid "``X0THR`` threshold for SVD inversion of the KS response matrix"
msgstr "``X0THR`` KS 响应矩阵 SVD 求逆的阈值"

msgid ""
"``KERNMOD`` if set to 1, DFSAPT computes (aux\\ :math:`|`\\ virt\\ "
":math:`\\times`\\ virt) integrals for use in the TDEXX kernel calculation "
"and stores them on disk. If set to 2, these integrals are directly "
"contracted to reduce I/O operations."
msgstr ""
"``KERNMOD`` 如果设置为 1，DFSAPT 会计算用于 TDEXX 核计算的 (aux\\ :math:`|`\\ virt\\ "
":math:`\\times`\\ virt) 积分并将其存储在磁盘上。如果设置为 2，则直接收缩这些积分以减少 I/O 操作。"

msgid ""
"``RESTART`` when set to 1, integral records are not deleted and can be used "
"for subsequent calculations. This is possible by using ``RESTART=2``."
msgstr "``RESTART`` 当设置为 1 时，积分记录不会被删除，可用于后续计算。这可以通过使用 ``RESTART=2`` 来实现。"

msgid ""
"``PLUSOV`` take terms that contain :math:`\\langle "
"occ|v_x^{\\text{NL}}-v_x|virt\\rangle` matrix elements into account in the "
"calculation of the kernel (normally very small)"
msgstr ""
"``PLUSOV`` 在核的计算中考虑包含 :math:`\\langle occ|v_x^{\\text{NL}}-v_x|virt\\rangle`"
" 矩阵元的项（通常非常小）"

msgid ""
"The DFSAPT program can also be used to compute the monomer response "
"functions within the exact-exchange Kohn-Sham response (TDEXX) approach, see"
" section `using exact exchange Kohn-Sham response kernels <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#using-exact-exchange-kohn-"
"sham-response-kernels>`__. As in the standard DFT-SAPT program, the "
":math:`\\langle i|v_x^{\\text{NL}}-v_x|j\\rangle` have to be computed for "
"each monomer using the OEP program (section `optimised Effective Potential "
"(OEP) method <the_density_functional_program.html#optimised-effective-"
"potential-oep-method>`__). An input template for this would be given by:"
msgstr ""
"DFSAPT 程序也可用于在精确交换 Kohn-Sham 响应 (TDEXX) 方法内计算单体响应函数，参见章节 `使用精确交换 Kohn-Sham "
"响应核 <symmetry-adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#using-exact-"
"exchange-kohn-sham-response-kernels>`__\\ 。与标准 DFT-SAPT 程序一样，对于每个单体，需要使用 OEP"
" 程序（章节 `优化有效势 (OEP) 方法 <the_density_functional_program.html#optimised-"
"effective-potential-oep-method>`__\\ ）计算 :math:`\\langle "
"i|v_x^{\\text{NL}}-v_x|j\\rangle`\\ 。其输入模板如下："

msgid ""
"which again presents an example where the orbitals of the monomers are "
"calculated with the LPBE0AC xc potential. All publications resulting from "
"DFSAPT calculations employing the (A)TDEXX response kernel should cite Ref. "
"[9]."
msgstr ""
"这再次展示了一个示例，其中单体的轨道是使用 LPBE0AC xc 势计算的。所有使用 (A)TDEXX 响应核进行 DFSAPT "
"计算所产生的出版物都应引用参考文献 [9]。"

msgid "DFSAPT calculation of the water dimer using a DCBS basis set"
msgstr "使用 DCBS 基组计算水二聚体的 DFSAPT"

msgid "DFSAPT calculation of the water dimer using an MCBS basis set"
msgstr "使用 MCBS 基组计算水二聚体的 DFSAPT"

msgid "DFSAPT calculation of the water dimer using an MC+BS basis set"
msgstr "使用 MC+BS 基组计算水二聚体的 DFSAPT"

msgid "DFSAPT calculation of the water dimer with additional d(HF) correction"
msgstr "带有额外 d(HF) 校正的水二聚体 DFSAPT 计算"

msgid "SAPT(CCSD)"
msgstr "SAPT(CCSD)"

msgid ""
"SAPT with monomers described on the CCSD level is available for small "
"complexes. In SAPT(CCSD) monomer density matrices and density-density matrix"
" response functions from expectation-value CCSD theory are utilized. A high "
"cost of SAPT(CCSD) results from the necessity of calculation of the CCSD "
"response functions. Cumulant contributions from two-electron density "
"matrices for :math:`E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}` and :math:`E_{\\text{exch-"
"ind}}^{(2)}` are also available. The calculations can be performed for "
"dimer-centered or monomer-centered-plus basis sets (the latter for all "
"components but :math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{exch-disp}}`). "
":math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{disp}}` and :math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{exch-disp}}` are "
"usually calculated from density-fitted response functions in order to reduce"
" the CPU time (from :math:`{\\cal O}({\\cal N}^8)` to :math:`{\\cal "
"O}({\\cal N}^7)`, where :math:`{\\cal N}` is the molecular size). Note that "
":math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{disp}}` and :math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{exch-disp}}` are "
"calculated separately from other SAPT components. It is important to note "
"that SAPT(CCSD) and DFT-SAPT from Chapter `introduction <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#introduction>`__ are "
"completely different codes."
msgstr ""
"对于描述在 CCSD 水平上的单体，SAPT 可用于小型复合物。在 SAPT(CCSD) 中，利用了来自期望值 CCSD 理论的单体密度矩阵和密度-"
"密度矩阵响应函数。SAPT(CCSD) 的高成本源于计算 CCSD 响应函数的必要性。来自双电子密度矩阵对 "
":math:`E_{\\text{exch}}^{(1)}` 和 :math:`E_{\\text{exch-ind}}^{(2)}` "
"的累积贡献也可用。计算可以在二聚体中心或单体中心加基组下进行（后者适用于除 :math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{exch-disp}}` "
"外的所有分量）。\\ :math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{disp}}` 和 :math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{exch-"
"disp}}` 通常使用密度拟合的响应函数计算，以减少 CPU 时间（从 :math:`{\\cal O}({\\cal N}^8)` 减少到 "
":math:`{\\cal O}({\\cal N}^7)`\\ ，其中 :math:`{\\cal N}` 是分子尺寸）。请注意，\\ "
":math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{disp}}` 和 :math:`E^{(2)}_{\\text{exch-disp}}` 是与其他 "
"SAPT 分量分开计算的。需要指出的是，SAPT(CCSD) 与第 `引言 <symmetry-"
"adapted_intermolecular_perturbation_theory.html#introduction>`__ 章中的 DFT-"
"SAPT 是完全不同的代码。"

msgid "MP2-coupled (MP2C)"
msgstr "MP2-耦合 (MP2C)"

msgid ""
"The standard second-order Møller-Plesset perturbation theory (MP2) method "
"fails to describe long-range correlation energies accurately. The reason for"
" this stems from the fact that the MP2 method does not take into account "
"intramolecular correlation effects of two interacting monomers, i.e., "
"describes dispersion interactions on an uncoupled Hartree-Fock level [1]. To"
" remedy this, the supermolecular MP2 interaction energy can be corrected in "
"a hybrid supermolecular-perturbation theory approach by subtracting the "
"uncoupled HF (UCHF) dispersion energy and adding the dispersion energy from "
"a more accurate response theory method instead. In the MP2C (MP2 coupled) "
"method, the latter is computed using the time-dependent density-functional "
"theory (TDDFT) approach employing static response functions from the EXX "
"method and coupled response functions computed by using the ALDA exchange "
"kernel:"
msgstr ""
"标准的二阶 Møller-Plesset 微扰理论 (MP2) 方法无法准确描述长程关联能。其原因在于 MP2 "
"方法未考虑两个相互作用单体的分子内相关效应，即在非耦合 Hartree-Fock 水平上描述色散相互作用 [1]。为弥补此缺陷，超分子 MP2 "
"相互作用能可通过一种混合的超分子-微扰理论方法进行校正，即减去非耦合 HF (UCHF) 色散能，并代之以更精确的响应理论方法计算的色散能。在 MP2C"
" (MP2 耦合) 方法中，后者使用时依赖密度泛函理论 (TDDFT) 方法计算，该方法采用来自 EXX 方法的静态响应函数，以及使用 ALDA "
"交换核计算的耦合响应函数："

msgid ""
"\\Delta E_{\\text{int}}^{\\text{MP2C}}=\\Delta E_{\\text{int}}^{\\text{MP2}}\n"
"                       -E_{\\text{disp}}^{(20)}[\\mbox{UCHF}]\n"
"                       +E_{\\text{disp}}^{(2)}[\\mbox{TDDFT}]"
msgstr ""
"\\Delta E_{\\text{int}}^{\\text{MP2C}}=\\Delta E_{\\text{int}}^{\\text{MP2}}\n"
"                       -E_{\\text{disp}}^{(20)}[\\mbox{UCHF}]\n"
"                       +E_{\\text{disp}}^{(2)}[\\mbox{TDDFT}]"

msgid ""
"In Molpro, MP2C calculations can be performed with the aid of the TDDFT "
"module that computes frequency-dependent coupled or uncoupled response "
"functions. Using the LHF (Local Hartree-Fock) method (section `local "
"Hartree-Fock (LHF) method <the_density_functional_program.html#local-"
"hartree-fock-lhf-method>`__) an input for computing the MP2C interaction "
"energy could read (using density-fitting within the HF/MP2 calculations and "
"using 10 frequency integration points)"
msgstr ""
"在 Molpro 中，MP2C 计算可借助 TDDFT 模块进行，该模块计算频率依赖的耦合或非耦合响应函数。使用 LHF (局域 Hartree-"
"Fock) 方法（章节 `local Hartree-Fock (LHF) method "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#local-hartree-fock-lhf-method>`__\\ "
"），计算 MP2C 相互作用能的输入示例如下（在 HF/MP2 计算中使用密度拟合，并使用 10 个频率积分点）"

msgid ""
"Notice that in the basis input section a number of basis sets have to be "
"specified for the different parts in the calculation."
msgstr "请注意，在基组输入部分，必须为计算的不同部分指定多个基组。"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, the MP2C method can also be used in combination with the OEP "
"method described in section `optimised Effective Potential (OEP) method "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#optimised-effective-potential-oep-"
"method>`__. In this case, the latter part where the coupled dispersion "
"energy is calculated would have to be replaced by something like:"
msgstr ""
"或者，MP2C 方法也可与章节 `optimised Effective Potential (OEP) method "
"<the_density_functional_program.html#optimised-effective-potential-oep-"
"method>`__ 中描述的 OEP 方法结合使用。在这种情况下，计算耦合色散能的后半部分将需要替换为类似以下内容："

msgid ""
"The ``TDDFT`` program used to compute the response functions can have the "
"following further options:"
msgstr "用于计算响应函数的 ``TDDFT`` 程序可具有以下进一步选项："

msgid "**ORB** record containing orbital coefficients (mandatory)"
msgstr "**ORB** 记录，包含轨道系数（必需）"

msgid ""
"**SAVE** record number used to save the response matrix (in the auxiliary "
"basis) for each frequency"
msgstr "**SAVE** 记录号，用于为每个频率保存响应矩阵（在辅助基组中）"

msgid ""
"**ORDER** can be used to denote the order of the electron-electron "
"interaction that is taken into account in the calculation of the response "
"matrix, so ``ORDER=0`` corresponds to the uncoupled case. If set to a "
"negative value (default) the electron-electron interactions are taken into "
"account through infinite order (fully coupled case, the default setting)"
msgstr ""
"**ORDER** 可用于表示在响应矩阵计算中考虑到的电子-电子相互作用的阶数，因此 ``ORDER=0`` "
"对应于非耦合情况。如果设置为负值（默认值），则通过无穷阶考虑电子-电子相互作用（完全耦合情况，默认设置）"

msgid ""
"**NORM** may be used to change the fitting norm (default ’J’, should better "
"not be changed)"
msgstr "**NORM** 可用于更改拟合范数（默认 'J'，最好不更改）"

msgid ""
"**3IDX** a logical flag (choices: 0/1) to specify if the xc-kernel matrix "
"should be computed by using 3-indexed (aux\\ :math:`|f_{\\text{xc}}|`\\ "
"occ\\ :math:`\\times`\\ virt) integrals"
msgstr ""
"**3IDX** 一个逻辑标志（选项：0/1），用于指定是否应使用 3 索引（辅助\\ :math:`|f_{\\text{xc}}|`\\ 占据\\ "
":math:`\\times`\\ 虚）积分来计算 xc 核矩阵"

msgid "**GRIDTHR** threshold for quadrature integration"
msgstr "**GRIDTHR** 求积积分的阈值"

msgid ""
"**GRIDFREE** set to :math:`\\ne` 0 if the xc kernel matrix shall be computed"
" with a gridfree approach (see Ref. [2]). This is more efficient but can be "
"less accurate and is only recommended if used in conjunction with large "
"auxiliary basis sets."
msgstr ""
"**GRIDFREE** 如果 xc 核矩阵应使用无网格方法计算（参见文献 [2]），则设置为 :math:`\\ne` "
"0。这更高效，但可能精度较低，仅建议与大型辅助基组结合使用时使用。"

msgid ""
"**THRKERN** a threshold that is used to remove the singularities of the "
":math:`(P|f_{\\text{xc}}|Q)` matrix, see Ref. [3]"
msgstr "**THRKERN** 一个用于消除 :math:`(P|f_{\\text{xc}}|Q)` 矩阵奇异性的阈值，参见文献 [3]"

msgid "**XFAC** scaling factor of ALDA exchange"
msgstr "**XFAC** ALDA 交换的标度因子"

msgid "**CFAC** scaling factor of ALDA correlation"
msgstr "**CFAC** ALDA 相关的标度因子"

msgid "**NCORE** number of core orbitals"
msgstr "**NCORE** 芯轨道数量"

msgid ""
"**THRED** can be used to compress the size of the xc kernel values on the "
"grid in order to increase the efficiency (experimental)"
msgstr "**THRED** 可用于压缩格点上 xc 核值的大小以提高效率（实验性）"

msgid ""
"**FCX3MOD** switch between different computation modes for the calculation "
"of the (aux\\ :math:`|f_{\\text{xc}}|`\\ occ\\ :math:`\\times`\\ virt) "
"integrals"
msgstr ""
"**FCX3MOD** 用于计算 (aux\\ :math:`|f_{\\text{xc}}|`\\ occ\\ :math:`\\times`\\ "
"virt) 积分的不同计算模式之间的切换开关"

msgid ""
"**FXC2MOD** switch between different computation modes for the calculation "
"of the (aux\\ :math:`|f_{\\text{xc}}|`\\ aux) integrals"
msgstr "**FXC2MOD** 用于计算 (aux\\ :math:`|f_{\\text{xc}}|`\\ aux) 积分的不同计算模式之间的切换开关"

msgid ""
"**THRDUM** when integrating over a dummy centre and when the electron "
"density is lower than this value, skip the integration point (used to "
"eliminate the singularities of the xc kernel"
msgstr "**THRDUM** 当在虚拟中心上积分且电子密度低于此值时，跳过该积分点（用于消除 xc 核的奇点）"

msgid ""
"**SING** set to :math:`\\ne` 0 in order to employ a singularity correction "
"to the xc kernel matrix (is used by default)"
msgstr "**SING** 设置为 :math:`\\ne` 0 以对 xc 核矩阵应用奇点校正（默认使用）"

msgid "**POL** print polarisabilities"
msgstr "**POL** 打印极化率"

msgid "**ESHIFT** parameter :math:`\\alpha` in Eq. (5) in Ref. [3]"
msgstr "**ESHIFT** 参考文献 [3] 中方程 (5) 的参数 :math:`\\alpha`"

msgid "**FSCAL** parameter :math:`\\beta` in Eq. (5) in Ref. [3]"
msgstr "**FSCAL** 参考文献 [3] 中方程 (5) 的参数 :math:`\\beta`"

msgid ""
"**MATINV** flag for choosing matrix inversion routine to take inverse of the"
" metric matrix (1: LU decomposition and 2: SVD decomposition)."
msgstr "**MATINV** 选择矩阵求逆例程以计算度量矩阵逆矩阵的标志（1：LU 分解，2：SVD 分解）。"

msgid "**THRINV** threshold for SVD matrix inversion"
msgstr "**THRINV** SVD 矩阵求逆的阈值"

msgid ""
"All publications resulting from use of this program to compute MP2C "
"interaction energies should acknowledge Refs. [1] and [2]. If the "
"singularity correction to the xc kernel matrix is used, additionally also "
"Ref. [3] can be cited."
msgstr ""
"所有使用本程序计算 MP2C 相互作用能而发表的成果均应引用参考文献 [1] 和 [2]。如果使用了 xc 核矩阵的奇点校正，则还可额外引用参考文献 "
"[3]。"
